1
00:00:00,138 --> 00:00:01,138
I say "All aboard."

2
00:00:01,306 --> 00:00:02,976
(Sheldon:)You sit quietly and watch.

3
00:00:04,943 --> 00:00:06,423
(Wil:)Can I blow the whistle?

4
00:00:08,547 --> 00:00:09,787
(Sheldon:)You should probably go.

5
00:00:17,589 --> 00:00:19,299
You're going to brush
your teeth on my couch?

6
00:00:19,457 --> 00:00:21,567
No, I'm going to brush
Cinnamon's teeth.

7
00:00:22,627 --> 00:00:23,567
(Howard:)Why bother?

8
00:00:23,728 --> 00:00:26,068
(Howard:)She spends half the time
licking her butt.

9
00:00:27,332 --> 00:00:28,642
(Raj:)And the other half
licking my face.

10
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:30,510
Thats why I'm brushing her teeth.

11
00:00:32,671 --> 00:00:34,511
(Bernadette:)Hey, guys.
Sorry I'm so late.

12
00:00:34,673 --> 00:00:37,123
(Bernadette:)-Did you already have dinner?
-No, we were waiting for you.

13
00:00:37,309 --> 00:00:38,409
(Bernadette:)That's so sweet.

14
00:00:38,576 --> 00:00:40,816
(Howard:)Yeah. So what do you
feel like making?

15
00:00:42,347 --> 00:00:44,417
(Raj:)Howard, the poor thing
just got home from work.

16
00:00:44,583 --> 00:00:46,533
(Raj:)Let me get you a glass of wine.

17
00:00:46,685 --> 00:00:48,095
(Raj:)I'll cook dinner.

18
00:00:48,253 --> 00:00:50,033
(Bermadette:)-Oh, Raj, you're our guest.
-Don't be silly.

19
00:00:50,188 --> 00:00:52,028
(Sheldon:)Sit.
You look like you've had a long day.

20
00:00:52,190 --> 00:00:54,800
(Howard:)No, she always looks like that.

21
00:00:57,629 --> 00:01:02,019
(Howard:)Because she married an idiot.

